171
00:15:27,300 --> 00:15:28,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Look out!</font>

172
00:15:44,400 --> 00:15:54,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}"Tenkaichi Budokai"</font>

173
00:16:00,320 --> 00:16:01,790
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Are you alright, Bulma?!</font>

174
00:16:01,790 --> 00:16:03,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yes...</font>

175
00:16:12,200 --> 00:16:14,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Was that...</font>

176
00:16:14,670 --> 00:16:17,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The ring! It's gone!</font>

177
00:16:20,510 --> 00:16:25,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What on earth?!</font>

178
00:16:25,280 --> 00:16:30,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The ring has vaporized
in the blink of an eye!</font>

179
00:16:30,350 --> 00:16:33,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It truly is incredibly destructive!</font>

180
00:16:33,160 --> 00:16:35,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The <i>Kamehameha</i> pales in comparison!</font>

181
00:16:36,690 --> 00:16:39,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Where's Goku?!</font>

182
00:16:39,860 --> 00:16:43,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku's gone! He got vaporized, too!</font>

183
00:16:52,670 --> 00:16:55,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">- Son-<i>kun</i>!
- Is he dead?!</font>

184
00:17:05,620 --> 00:17:07,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku!</font>

185
00:17:08,790 --> 00:17:10,790
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Wait!</font>

186
00:17:10,790 --> 00:17:13,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He's alive. I can sense him!</font>

187
00:17:13,160 --> 00:17:17,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Really? Where?!</font>

188
00:17:18,830 --> 00:17:21,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He's alive...</font>

189
00:17:27,410 --> 00:17:29,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Where is he?!</font>

190
00:17:33,350 --> 00:17:35,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Above!</font>

191
00:17:55,770 --> 00:17:59,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's great! Neither of them died!</font>

192
00:17:59,040 --> 00:18:02,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There he is!</font>

193
00:18:02,210 --> 00:18:06,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Son has jumped
extremely high into the air!</font>

194
00:18:07,680 --> 00:18:09,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">When exactly did he do it?</font>

195
00:18:09,890 --> 00:18:12,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There's no way to describe
it except as a miracle!</font>

196
00:18:30,640 --> 00:18:32,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Impressive!</font>

197
00:18:32,740 --> 00:18:37,380
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You did well to jump this
high up at that exact moment!</font>

198
00:18:37,380 --> 00:18:39,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's an amazing technique!</font>

199
00:18:39,720 --> 00:18:40,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You were right...</font>

200
00:18:40,880 --> 00:18:44,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I really might've died if I hadn't dodged it!</font>

201
00:18:49,990 --> 00:18:53,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Too bad, though.</font>

202
00:18:53,560 --> 00:18:56,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now you've lost.</font>

203
00:18:59,500 --> 00:19:01,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">All you can do now is fall.</font>

204
00:19:01,770 --> 00:19:04,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But the fighting ring is gone.</font>

205
00:19:04,740 --> 00:19:08,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Meaning that the loser of this match</font>

206
00:19:08,510 --> 00:19:12,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">will be the first person to hit the ground.</font>

207
00:19:12,180 --> 00:19:16,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But I can fly freely with the <i>Bukujutsu</i>!</font>

208
00:19:16,420 --> 00:19:19,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The outcome is clear.</font>

209
00:19:23,090 --> 00:19:25,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's all over...</font>

210
00:19:25,630 --> 00:19:28,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So that's why he did it...</font>

211
00:19:29,130 --> 00:19:30,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He won!</font>

212
00:19:32,200 --> 00:19:35,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Try a taste of my final attack!</font>

213
00:19:35,140 --> 00:19:36,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What?!</font>

214
00:19:38,670 --> 00:19:43,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll use all of my remaining energy for it!</font>

215
00:19:44,010 --> 00:19:49,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You can't move freely in the air,
so what exactly can you do?!</font>

216
00:19:49,120 --> 00:19:52,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">After that last technique,
your movements should be dulled too!</font>

217
00:19:52,350 --> 00:19:53,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Here goes!</font>

218
00:19:55,620 --> 00:19:58,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Kame...</i></font>

219
00:19:58,160 --> 00:20:02,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What?! The <i>Kamehameha</i>?!</font>

220
00:20:02,630 --> 00:20:08,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It appears that Son is
preparing to do a <i>Kamehameha</i>!</font>

221
00:20:09,870 --> 00:20:13,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The <i>Kamehameha</i> up here, of all things?</font>

222
00:20:13,840 --> 00:20:16,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's completely ineffective against me!</font>

223
00:20:16,140 --> 00:20:18,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're just putting up futile resistance!</font>

224
00:20:23,690 --> 00:20:26,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...<i>ha</i>...</font>

225
00:20:26,020 --> 00:20:30,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No! He can't defeat him
with the <i>Kamehameha</i>!</font>

226
00:20:30,030 --> 00:20:32,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But this is Goku we're talking about;</font>

227
00:20:32,690 --> 00:20:36,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">it could be a really huge <i>Kamehameha</i>!</font>

228
00:20:36,330 --> 00:20:42,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No. The <i>Kamehameha</i> itself
doesn't work on Tenshinhan!</font>

229
00:20:42,270 --> 00:20:44,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Regardless of size.</font>

230
00:20:44,670 --> 00:20:47,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No way!</font>

231
00:20:47,410 --> 00:20:51,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's all over! He's lost!</font>

232
00:20:51,050 --> 00:20:52,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...<i>me</i>...</font>

233
00:20:52,710 --> 00:20:55,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">All you're going to do
is waste your energy!</font>

234
00:21:00,220 --> 00:21:01,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What?!</font>

235
00:21:01,420 --> 00:21:03,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He turned around!</font>

236
00:21:03,090 --> 00:21:06,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...<i>ha</i>!</font>

237
00:21:10,700 --> 00:21:13,530
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Not even you can move fast in mid-air!</font>

238
00:21:13,540 --> 00:21:15,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now I see!</font>

239
00:21:17,240 --> 00:21:18,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, no!</font>

240
00:21:24,900 --> 00:21:26,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">- Way to go!
- Way to go!</font>

241
00:21:27,800 --> 00:21:35,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Son used the <i>Kamehameha</i>'s momentum
to connect with a body blow!</font>

242
00:21:40,250 --> 00:21:41,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ten-<i>san</i>!</font>

243
00:21:41,850 --> 00:21:44,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Tenshinhan looks unconscious!</font>

244
00:21:44,320 --> 00:21:46,920
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He did it! He won!</font>

245
00:21:46,920 --> 00:21:50,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Wait! It's too close to tell!</font>

246
00:21:56,200 --> 00:22:00,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But Son is falling with him!</font>

247
00:22:00,770 --> 00:22:05,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There's no way to tell who will land first!</font>

248
00:22:05,210 --> 00:22:06,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This is bad!</font>

249
00:22:06,510 --> 00:22:09,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I used too much energy
for the <i>Kamehameha</i>...</font>

250
00:22:09,110 --> 00:22:11,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I can't move my body!</font>

251
00:22:15,680 --> 00:22:17,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll go check it out!</font>

252
00:22:35,570 --> 00:22:38,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh! They're nearly even!</font>

253
00:22:38,070 --> 00:22:42,530
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No, Son is at a slight disadvantage!</font>

254
00:22:44,410 --> 00:22:46,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Darn it!</font>

255
00:22:48,750 --> 00:22:55,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Kamehameha</i>!</font>

256
00:22:58,560 --> 00:23:03,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Although it wasn't much,
Son managed a small <i>Kamehameha</i>!</font>

257
00:23:03,630 --> 00:23:07,430
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now he has the advantage!</font>

258
00:23:07,430 --> 00:23:09,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Alright!</font>

259
00:23:45,170 --> 00:23:49,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">How unlucky for Son!</font>

260
00:23:49,280 --> 00:23:55,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He collided with a moving car
and hit the ground first!</font>

261
00:23:56,950 --> 00:24:00,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Tenshinhan wins!</font>

262
00:24:00,320 --> 00:24:02,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He's the champion!</font>

263
00:24:02,660 --> 00:24:07,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The title of world's strongest
belongs to Tenshinhan!</font>

264
00:24:21,550 --> 00:24:23,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Amazing!</font>

265
00:24:23,320 --> 00:24:27,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What a truly incredible match
that turned out to be!</font>

266
00:24:30,060 --> 00:24:33,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The victorious Tenshinhan...</font>

267
00:24:38,440 --> 00:24:41,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The defeated Son...</font>

268
00:24:42,740 --> 00:24:48,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There is no way to give
enough praise to these two!</font>

269
00:24:48,210 --> 00:24:49,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Son-<i>kun</i>...</font>

270
00:24:58,220 --> 00:24:59,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku!</font>

271
00:24:59,620 --> 00:25:01,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let's go.</font>

272
00:25:01,420 --> 00:25:03,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">To see Goku.</font>

273
00:25:03,560 --> 00:25:05,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yeah...</font>

274
00:25:34,600 --> 00:25:37,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku!</font>

275
00:25:37,140 --> 00:25:38,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Kuririn!</font>

276
00:25:50,580 --> 00:25:52,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Congratulations!</font>

277
00:25:52,320 --> 00:25:54,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">- Congratulations!
- Bravo!</font>

278
00:25:59,830 --> 00:26:02,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You were great!</font>

279
00:26:02,460 --> 00:26:05,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll never forget this match!</font>

280
00:26:05,060 --> 00:26:07,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Three cheers for Tenshinhan!</font>

281
00:26:07,070 --> 00:26:10,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hurray!</font>

282
00:26:10,010 --> 00:26:13,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Tenshinhan!</font>

283
00:26:16,450 --> 00:26:21,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">See you again in three years! Bye!</font>

284
00:26:24,420 --> 00:26:27,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This year's tournament is finally over, too...</font>

285
00:26:27,490 --> 00:26:30,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So many great matches!</font>

286
00:26:30,330 --> 00:26:33,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You were so close, Goku...</font>

287
00:26:33,130 --> 00:26:36,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If only you hadn't hit that car...</font>

288
00:26:36,130 --> 00:26:39,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, well. A loss is a loss!</font>

289
00:26:41,810 --> 00:26:44,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Your clothes are all torn up!</font>

290
00:26:44,010 --> 00:26:47,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hold on. I'll give you mine.</font>

291
00:26:50,180 --> 00:26:51,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Tenshinhan...</font>

292
00:26:51,480 --> 00:26:55,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Son Goku. There's something
I want you to accept.</font>

293
00:26:59,490 --> 00:27:03,190
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Isn't that the prize money?</font>

294
00:27:03,190 --> 00:27:08,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yes. I want you to have half.</font>

295
00:27:08,000 --> 00:27:09,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I only won because of luck.</font>

296
00:27:09,830 --> 00:27:12,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">In terms of skill, I lost.</font>

297
00:27:16,640 --> 00:27:18,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No thanks.</font>

298
00:27:18,140 --> 00:27:21,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I don't even know how to use money...</font>

299
00:27:21,510 --> 00:27:23,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But!</font>

300
00:27:25,720 --> 00:27:28,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Luck is also part of one's skill!</font>

301
00:27:28,150 --> 00:27:31,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">And with an expert like you around,</font>

302
00:27:31,690 --> 00:27:35,390
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku has learned all sorts of things!</font>

303
00:27:35,390 --> 00:27:38,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yeah!</font>

304
00:27:38,030 --> 00:27:41,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What are you standing around for?</font>

305
00:27:41,030 --> 00:27:43,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">- Let's get going.
- Yeah!</font>

306
00:27:52,560 --> 00:27:55,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Congratulations on winning the title.</font>

307
00:27:55,860 --> 00:27:57,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Forgive me.</font>

308
00:27:57,660 --> 00:28:01,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I did something horrible to you.</font>

309
00:28:01,830 --> 00:28:05,530
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't worry about it.
It was better than being killed.</font>

310
00:28:07,490 --> 00:28:11,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll take you on again sometime!</font>

311
00:28:11,800 --> 00:28:13,230
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Sure!</font>

312
00:28:13,230 --> 00:28:18,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">By the way, what are you
two going to do now?</font>

313
00:28:18,000 --> 00:28:23,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'd be more than happy
to have you stay with me...</font>

314
00:28:23,970 --> 00:28:26,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yeah! I agree!</font>

315
00:28:27,310 --> 00:28:29,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I love your wildness!</font>

316
00:28:33,040 --> 00:28:35,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I appreciate the offer,</font>

317
00:28:35,250 --> 00:28:37,380
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">but we're still the Crane Hermit's students,</font>

318
00:28:37,380 --> 00:28:40,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">even if we did betray him.</font>

319
00:28:40,050 --> 00:28:43,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We can't audaciously go with you.</font>

320
00:28:43,590 --> 00:28:46,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Chaozu and I will go and live somewhere.</font>

321
00:28:46,260 --> 00:28:48,820
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I see.</font>

322
00:28:48,830 --> 00:28:50,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Damn...</font>

323
00:28:50,030 --> 00:28:52,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Then let's be pen pals!</font>

324
00:28:54,060 --> 00:28:55,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What do you all say?</font>

325
00:28:55,770 --> 00:28:58,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Why don't we go get something to eat?</font>

326
00:28:58,270 --> 00:29:03,570
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku and Tenshinhan need to eat
a lot to restore their strength!</font>

327
00:29:03,570 --> 00:29:06,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Agreed!</font>

328
00:29:06,110 --> 00:29:09,570
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">In that case, let me handle the bill!</font>

329
00:29:11,920 --> 00:29:15,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Someone here eats an
unbelievable amount, you know!</font>

330
00:29:26,620 --> 00:29:28,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's wrong?</font>

331
00:29:28,120 --> 00:29:29,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, no!</font>

332
00:29:29,590 --> 00:29:34,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I left my Grandpa's Dragon Ball
and the <i>Nyoibou</i> at the arena!</font>

333
00:29:34,730 --> 00:29:35,930
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll go get them!</font>

334
00:29:35,930 --> 00:29:38,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's okay, I'll get them for you!</font>

335
00:29:38,300 --> 00:29:41,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">- You're dead tired, aren't you?
- I'm fine...</font>

336
00:29:43,600 --> 00:29:47,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">- I'll get 'em for you!
- Really? Thank you!</font>

337
00:29:47,400 --> 00:29:49,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Order some food for me!</font>

338
00:29:51,930 --> 00:29:54,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm so hungry...</font>

339
00:29:54,600 --> 00:29:56,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Kuririn's taking a long time...</font>

340
00:29:56,400 --> 00:29:58,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What could he be doing?</font>

341
00:29:58,200 --> 00:30:00,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm so hungry...</font>

342
00:30:02,440 --> 00:30:05,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I can't endure it anymore...</font>

343
00:30:05,180 --> 00:30:08,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">In that case, let's start eating...</font>

344
00:30:08,210 --> 00:30:10,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I humbly accept this meal!</font>

345
00:30:14,090 --> 00:30:17,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh? Aren't you going to eat, Goku-<i>san</i>?</font>

346
00:30:17,620 --> 00:30:20,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll eat when Kuririn gets back.</font>

347
00:30:20,890 --> 00:30:23,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Forget about him.
He wanders off all the time...</font>

348
00:30:23,800 --> 00:30:26,930
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yeah. Your food'll get cold, Son-<i>kun</i>.</font>

349
00:30:38,450 --> 00:30:40,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What is it, Son Goku?!</font>

350
00:30:51,420 --> 00:30:53,590
